{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31116","headline":"寄吉谏议 · 薛能","name":"寄吉谏议","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将迎须学返抽身，合致蹉跎敢效颦。\n性静拟归无上士，迹疎常负有情人。\n终凭二顷谋婚嫁，谬着千篇断斧斤。\n闻说旧交贤且达，欲弹章甫自羞贫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31116.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31116","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}